    <diagram name="2 Registry" id="p2">
        <mxGraphModel dx="1736" dy="859" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1400" pageHeight="900" math="0" shadow="0">
            <root>
                <mxCell id="0"/>
                <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
                <mxCell id="t" value="registry_manager — the coordination point. Nothing moves between stages without a status change here." style="text;align=left;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1100" height="40" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="clients" value="CLIENTS (all via HTTP, all poll)&#xa;&#xa;download_manager: get_status (skip known) · update_status downloaded (+domain, published_at) · get_last_checkpoint&#xa;scripts/register_pdfs.py: get_status · update_status downloaded&#xa;parse_manager: get_status (==downloaded? ==parsed?) · update_status parsed · update_status processed&#xa;embedding_manager: get_status (==processed?) · update_status embedded&#xa;prune_manager: get_status per file&#xa;scripts/pipeline_status.py, wait_for_ingestion.py: read the SQLite file directly (read-only)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="620" height="170" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="api" value="main.py  FastAPI on 127.0.0.1:4000&#xa;&#xa;POST /update_status  {filename, status, domain?, published_at?, error_msg?}  → {success: bool}&#xa;      pydantic StatusUpdate: strips strings; status ∈ STATUS_TYPE; error requires error_msg&#xa;GET  /get_status      {filename}  → {status: str | null}      (JSON body on a GET)&#xa;POST /get_last_checkpoint {domain} → {last_checkpoint: ISO date | null}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="290" width="620" height="140" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="fr" value="registry.py  FileRegistry (db_path = rag_registry.db in the service&#39;s cwd)&#xa;&#xa;_init_db(): CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS + index (domain, published_at) — runs on every start;&#xa;   schema changes never alter an existing file → reset deletes the DB file&#xa;update_status():&#xa;   downloaded → INSERT OR IGNORE (idempotent: re-registering is a no-op)&#xa;   parsed / processed / embedded → UPDATE status + &lt;stage&gt;_at = now, error_count = 0&#xa;   error → INSERT OR REPLACE, error_count += 1, last_error = msg&#xa;get_status(filename) → status or None&#xa;get_last_domain_date(domain) → MAX(published_at) WHERE status != error" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="460" width="620" height="200" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="db" value="&#xa;registry_manager/rag_registry.db  (SQLite)&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;file_status_table&#xa;  filename      TEXT PRIMARY KEY   ← PDF stem, the key used everywhere&#xa;  status        TEXT CHECK IN (downloaded, parsed, processed, embedded, error)&#xa;  domain        TEXT               ← downloader only&#xa;  published_at  TIMESTAMP          ← downloader only (checkpoint source)&#xa;  downloaded_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT now&#xa;  parsed_at / processed_at / embedded_at TIMESTAMP&#xa;  error_count   INTEGER DEFAULT 0&#xa;  last_error    TEXT" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=14;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=20" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="820" y="440" width="480" height="240" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="s0" value="(none)" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999;dashed=1" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="710" y="50" width="80" height="40" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="s1" value="downloaded" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="950" y="50" width="90" height="40" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="s2" value="parsed" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="955" y="130" width="80" height="40" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="s3" value="processed" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1150" y="130" width="90" height="40" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="s4" value="embedded" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1250" y="50" width="90" height="40" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="s5" value="error&#xa;(defined; no service sets it today)" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;dashed=1" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="950" y="180" width="200" height="50" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="es0" value="downloader / register_pdfs" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1" parent="1" source="s0" target="s1" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
