                <mxCell id="nx" value="WHAT FOLLOWS: the paper is searchable immediately. prune_manager deletes processed/&lt;stem&gt;.* on its next sweep. The UI&#39;s paper list (/list_files) shows it." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;dashed=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8" parent="1" vertex="1">
